OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARare birds breed 'furthest north
OL,4,Ain 70 years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe males of the species, are known for
OL,7,Ftheir distinctively "booming" mating
OL,8,Fcall which can travel 3 miles (5km).
OL,9,FBitterns were driven to extinction in
OL,10,FBritain in the 1870s and nearly
OL,11,Fsuffered a second extinction in the
OL,12,F1990s.
OL,14,FNHSH director Clare Freeman said: "This
OL,15,Fis absolutely fantastic news and one of
OL,16,Fthe most exciting developments we've
OL,17,Fhad."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
